OL,3,GNEWSAChild in 'stable condition' as
OL,4,Apolice continue murder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old girl is in a stable
OL,7,Fcondition and a 16-year-old has been
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,9,Fattempted murder after an incident in
OL,10,FDungannon on Saturday.
OL,12,FThe body of a 61-year-old man was found
OL,13,Falongside his injured daughter at a
OL,14,Fhouse in Lisnahull Road at about 11:00
OL,15,FBST.
OL,17,FThe man's wife, 48, who sustained
OL,18,Fnon-life threatening injuries during
OL,19,Fthe incident, has been released from
OL,20,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
